  "releaseNotes": "Version: 4.4.1\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\n \nVersion: 4.4.0\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\n \nVersion: 4.3.0\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\n \nVersion: 4.2.0\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\n \nVersion: 4.1.1\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\n \nVersion: 4.1.0\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\n \nVersion: 4.0.3\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\n \nVersion: 4.0.2\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies to latest and greatest with respect to TFMs\n \nVersion: 4.0.1\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies to latest and greatest with respect to TFMs\n \nVersion: 4.0.0\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- REMOVED Support for TFM .NET 6 (LTS)\n- CHANGED Dependencies to latest and greatest with respect to TFMs\n \nVersion: 3.0.0\nAvailability: .NET 8 and .NET 6\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies to latest and greatest with respect to TFMs\n \n# New Features\n- ADDED MessageExtensions class in the Savvyio.Messaging.Cryptography namespace that consist of extension methods for the IMessage{T} interface: Sign{T}\n- ADDED SignedMessage{T} record in the Savvyio.Messaging.Cryptography namespace that provides a default implementation of the ISignedMessage{T} interface\n- ADDED SignedMessageExtensions class in the Savvyio.Messaging.Cryptography namespace that consist of extension methods for the ISignedMessage{T} interface: CheckSignature{T}\n- ADDED SignedMessageOptions class in the Savvyio.Messaging.Cryptography namespace that specifies options that is related to wrapping an IRequest implementation inside a cryptographically signed message\n- ADDED Acknowledgeable class in the Savvyio.Messaging namespace that provides a default implementation of the IAcknowledgeable interface\n- ADDED Message record in the Savvyio.Messaging namespace that provides a default implementation of the IMessage{T} interface\n- ADDED MessageAsyncEnumerable class in the Savvyio.Messaging namespace that exposes an enumerator that provides asynchronous iteration over values of a specified type\n- ADDED MessageAsyncEnumerableOptions class in the Savvyio.Messaging namespace that specifies options that is related to IAcknowledgeable messages\n- ADDED MessageExtensions class in the Savvyio.Messaging namespace that consist of extension methods for the IMessage{T} interface: Clone{T}\n- ADDED MessageOptions class in the Savvyio.Messaging namespace that is related to wrapping an IRequest implementation inside a message",
